"""A document-local recognizer for recurring short lexical constructions.

Listed English relational/temporal phrases produce negative pulses; quoted
lookup and DOM arguments usually produce positive ones. Other rules cover
nested parentheses, LaTeX equation/cases boundaries, repeated middle dots,
